  "contentHtml": "<P>소화, 순환, 호흡을 배우고 나서<BR><BR>과학만화 말풍선달기 활동을 했습니다.<BR><BR>자세한 내용은 첨부파일 열어보시구요.<BR><BR>많은 아이디어 교차 있길 기대합니다.<BR><BR>고맙습니다.</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DF1n%26dataid%3D14%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20140116152611&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile269.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F211D404F52D77B750DDA89')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_hwp_s.gif?rv=1.0.1\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 과학만화 그리기 활동(김영학).hwp</a></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P><!--StartFragment-->\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: &#49283;력&#50707;; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" ><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&lt;</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: &#49283;력&#50707;\">활동을 해보니</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: &#49283;력&#50707;; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >&gt;</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp; </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: &#49283;력&#50707;; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" ><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">1. </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &#49283;력&#50707;\">단순히 개념을 서술하는 활동보다 학생들이 흥미있어 한다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: &#49283;력&#50707;; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &#49283;력&#50707;; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\" ></SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: &#49283;력&#50707;; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >why? </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &#49283;력&#50707;\">말풍선을 재미있게 표현할 수 있다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: &#49283;력&#50707;; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &#49283;력&#50707;; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\" ></SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &#49283;력&#50707;\">그림에 색칠을 할 수 있다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: &#49283;력&#50707;; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &#49283;력&#50707;; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\" ></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp; </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: &#49283;력&#50707;; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" ><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">2. </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &#49283;력&#50707;\">비유적인 시각적 자료의 효과</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &#49283;력&#50707;; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\" ></SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &#49283;력&#50707;\">예</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: &#49283;력&#50707;; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >) </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &#49283;력&#50707;\">자동차 그림 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: &#49283;력&#50707;; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >: </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &#49283;력&#50707;\">적혈구를 비유</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: &#49283;력&#50707;; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >,</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &#49283;력&#50707;; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\" ></SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &#49283;력&#50707;\">미끄럼틀의 방향에 따른 다른 기체의 이동 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: &#49283;력&#50707;; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >: </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &#49283;력&#50707;\">폐포</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: &#49283;력&#50707;; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &#49283;력&#50707;\">모세혈관</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: &#49283;력&#50707;; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &#49283;력&#50707;\">산소</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: &#49283;력&#50707;; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >, </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &#49283;력&#50707;; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\" ></SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &#49283;력&#50707;\">이산화탄소의 이동을 이해하는데 도움이 된다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: &#49283;력&#50707;; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>----------------------------------------------------------------------------</P>\r\n<P>\r\n<TABLE border=0 cellSpacing=0 cellPadding=0 width=\"100%\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<TBODY>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD height=25 width=\"70%\">학생들을 열심히 참여시키는 치명적인 매력을 가지고 계신듯 하네요 ^^ http://www.imageparody.com 에 들어가셔도, 요새 학생들이 좋아할 만한 재밌는 그림들이 많아요.</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"15%\" align=right>[ 조광근 ]</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"10%\" align=right>2012-07-18</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"5%\" align=right><IMG style=\"CURSOR: hand\" border=0 src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/relay/cafe/original/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fsedu21.com%2Fimages%2Fboard_del.gif\"></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD height=1 background=/images/board_line.gif width=\"100%\" colSpan=4></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD height=25 width=\"70%\">샘 자료 좋네요. ^^ 수행평가나 단원 마무리용이나 학년말에 도서관 수업 병행하면서 해도 좋을 것 같아요. 관련 도서 찾아서 아이디어 얻어서 채우기. </TD>\r\n<TD width=\"15%\" align=right>[ 이지현 ]</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"10%\" align=right>2012-10-25</TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE></P>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
